{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"7fbd88a1f4dec4cb78a3232513f5a771b2c42f92a54e50b1560243bcddd990ab"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:3cc93b9e46b2c569d43f3c496317ef646afb69920d24bf6b18652e0b651f7036","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Local dance competition, festival performance, fair showcase, networking events, dance competition hosting, social media promotion, dance studio grand opening, investor meetings","evidence":"[D10:1 | 11:24 am on 25 April, 2023] Jon: Hi Gina! I just wanted to fill you in on my business. Yesterday, I went to a fair to show off my studio, it was both stressful and great! I got some possible leads, so that was awesome. But overall, I've learned that this biz is no cakewalk and having confidence in yourself is important for making it successful!\n[D16:6 | 2:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Jon: That's awesome, Gina! Yesterday I chose to go to networking events to make things happen. It's been tough but I'm staying determined and focused.\n[D8:4 | 1:26 pm on 3 April, 2023] Gina: Oof, that's tough, Jon. I got some new offers and promotions going on my online store to try and bring in new customers. It's been a wild ride starting my business, but I'm not giving up!","itemId":"urn:uuid:d8bead64-d52d-54b3-aee8-875ff7d51854","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4ad60883b226edb3a4e3e32dede589b82be7e491f12f33da5dc030bf1f4f96a6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which events has Jon participated in to promote his business venture?","referenceAnswer":"fair, networking events, dance competition","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4ad60883b226edb3a4e3e32dede589b82be7e491f12f33da5dc030bf1f4f96a6"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}